#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/libdriv/audiofile.xml:29
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"The <application>AudioFile</application> package contains the audio file "
"libraries and two sound file support programs useful to support basic sound "
"file formats."
msgstr ""
"O pacote <application>AudioFile</application> contém as bibliotecas de "
"arquivos de áudio e dois aplicativos de suporte a arquivos de som úteis para"
" suportar formatos básicos de arquivos de som."

