#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/libdriv/audiofile.xml:101
#, xml-text
msgid "Installation of AudioFile"
msgstr "Instalação do AudioFile"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/libdriv/audiofile.xml:104
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Install <application>AudioFile</application> by running the following "
"commands:"
msgstr ""
"Instale o <application>AudioFile</application> executando os seguintes "
"comandos:"

#.  No longer needed with the patch
#.      CXXFLAGS="${CXXFLAGS:- -O2 -g} -std=c++98"
#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/libdriv/audiofile.xml:111
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>patch -Np1 -i ../audiofile-&audiofile-version;-consolidated_patches-1.patch &amp;&amp;\n"
"autoreconf -fiv                             &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"./configure --prefix=/usr --disable-static  &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"make</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>patch -Np1 -i ../audiofile-&audiofile-version;-consolidated_patches-1.patch &amp;&amp;\n"
"autoreconf -fiv                             &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"./configure --prefix=/usr --disable-static  &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"make</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/libdriv/audiofile.xml:119
#, xml-text
msgid "Now, as the <systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user:"
msgstr ""
"Agora, como o(a) usuário(a) <systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem>:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/libdriv/audiofile.xml:122
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>make install</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>make install</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/libdriv/audiofile.xml:125
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"To test the results, issue: <command>make check</command>.  Note that the "
"tests will fail if the --disable-static option is used and tests are "
"executed before <command>make install</command>. You have three options:"
msgstr ""
"Para testar os resultados, emita: <command>make check</command>. Observe que"
" os testes falharão se a opção --disable-static for usada e os testes forem "
"executados antes de <command>make install</command>. Você tem três opções:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/libdriv/audiofile.xml:132
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"(a) configure without --disable-static, run the tests, but do not install, "
"then start a fresh build using --disable-static just for installing the "
"package."
msgstr ""
"(a) configure sem --disable-static, execute os testes, mas não instale; "
"então inicie uma nova construção usando --disable-static apenas para "
"instalar o pacote."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/libdriv/audiofile.xml:138
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"(b) configure with --disable-static, but only run the tests after the "
"package is installed."
msgstr ""
"(b) configure com --disable-static, mas somente execute os testes depois que"
" o pacote for instalado."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/libdriv/audiofile.xml:143
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"(c) configure with --disable-static, but only run the tests after a DESTDIR "
"install."
msgstr ""
"(c) configure com --disable-static, mas somente execute os testes depois de "
"uma instalação DESTDIR."

